<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Chapter 18 — Resilience Patterns (pattern view).
    resilience/  timeout, retry, bulkhead, circuit breaker, fallback as small composable decorators
    sim/         a discrete-event model of tracking-service (50 workers) and a browning-out maps provider
    simulation/  six scenarios, one pattern added at a time: cascading failure, retry storms, recovery
    app/         the same stack in Spring Boot 4: HTTP client timeouts, @Retryable and @ConcurrencyLimit
                 (Spring Framework 7), Spring Cloud CircuitBreaker on Resilience4j with a fallback
-->
